-08-27 12:32:29','2025-08-27 12:32:29'),('d0f9c215-9479-488b-a9d1-0ca9ddc88fa3','Fancy Nancy',NULL,'Fancy Nancy and her class learn about poetry and write their own poems to read on Family Day at school.',0,NULL,'',0,'',0,'approved',NULL,'2025-08-27 12:32:29','2025-08-27 12:32:29'),('d11d68c8-826f-4c6f-9ec2-df5a77200232','The Odds of Getting Even',NULL,'342 pages ; 22 cm.540L Lexile',0,NULL,'OL25884357M',368,'',0,'approved',NULL,'2025-08-27 12:32:29','2025-08-27 12:32:29'),('d15e2bb0-6a58-4905-b167-87a04b213025','The Visual Display of Quantitative Information',NULL,'see https://archive.org/details/visualdisplayofq0000edwa/',0,NULL,'OL3966475M',197,'',0,'approved',NULL,'2025-08-27 12:32:29','2025-08-27 12:32:29'),('d165e4fc-0cab-4c47-aca9-c603c157a8d9','Melancholy Death of Oyster Boy and Other Stories',NULL,'',0,NULL,'OL672427M',128,'',0,'approved',NULL,'2025-08-27 12:32:29','2025-08-27 12:32:29'),('d171bb45-6da5-4b28-a9c2-1678e21c47b4','Rime of the ancient mariner',NULL,'',0,NULL,'OL13498346M',54,'',0,'approved',NULL,'2025-08-27 12:32:29','2025-08-27 12:32:29'),('d17b635d-818a-432b-b091-f23d687a590e','Children of Blood and Bone',NULL,'Zélie Adebola remembers when the soil of Orïsha hummed with magic. Burners ignited flames, Tiders beckoned waves, and Zélie\'s Reaper mother summoned forth souls. But everything changed the night magic disappeared. Under the orders of a ruthless king, maji were killed, leaving Zélie without a mother and her people without hope.',0,NULL,'OL26879357M',552,'',0,'approved',NULL,'2025-08-27 12:32:29','2025-08-27 12:32:29'),('d19a401d-c20d-46e0-8473-edc294385961','My Lesbian Experience With Loneliness',NULL,'The heart-rending autobiographical manga that\'s taken the internet by storm! My Lesbian Experience with Loneliness is an honest and heartfelt look at one young woman\'s exploration of her sexuality, mental well-being, and growing up in our modern age. Told using expressive artwork that invokes both laughter and tears, this moving and highly entertaining single volume depicts not only the artist\'s burgeoning sexuality, but many other personal aspects of her life that will resonate with readers.',5,NULL,'OL26930178M',142,'',0,'approved',NULL,'2025-08-27 12:32:29','2025-08-27 12:32:29'),('d1c22153-1112-4fb1-b678-d7a57b9306c7','Stories of Your Life and Others',NULL,'',0,NULL,'OL3956559M',295,'',0,'approved',NULL,'2025-08-27 12:32:29','2025-08-27 12:32:29'),('d1cb2c3e-3f66-4461-9271-2f9846324f6f','The Art of War',NULL,'',0,NULL,'OL8784104M',96,'',0,'approved',NULL,'2025-08-27 12:32:29','2025-08-27 12:32:29'),('d21010b9-8b05-465a-8fa9-fbb4b37a5232','The Tears of Suicide',NULL,'',0,NULL,'OL27533228M',175,'',0,'approved',NULL,'2025-08-27 12:32:29','2025-08-27 12:32:29'),('d215da6b-6b1c-4e2d-a458-33931094be3f','La Nuit',NULL,'\"Night--A terrifying account of the Nazi death camp horror that turns a young Jewish boy into an agonized witness to the death of his family...the death of his innocence...and the death of his God. Penetrating and powerful, as personal as The diary of Anne Frank, Night awakens the shocking memory of evil at its absolute and carries with it the unforgettable message that this horror must never be allowed to happen again\"--Provided by publisher.',0,NULL,'',135,'',0,'approved',NULL,'2025-08-27 12:32:29','2025-08-27 12:32:29'),('d2247c88-0d55-4aec-a618-fc9030766321','Bared to You',NULL,'',0,NULL,'OL25317242M',352,'',0,'approved',NULL,'2025-08-27 12:32:29','2025-08-27 12:32:29'),('d2262297-5e36-4071-a4c9-6afd4ac091c8','Keeper of the Lost Cities Collection Books 1-5',NULL,'',0,NULL,'OL26869762M',3104,'',0,'approved',NULL,'2025-08-27 12:32:29','2025-08-27 12:32:29'),('d230e89c-1d6b-44e7-a974-04153051e9a9','Winning',NULL,'During his forty-year career at General Electric, Welch led the company to year-after-year success around the globe, in multiple markets, against brutal competition. His honest, be-the-best style of management became the gold standard in business, with his relentless focus on people, teamwork, and profits. Since Welch retired in 2001 as chairman and CEO of General Electric, he has traveled the world, speaking and answering questions. Now, he has written both a philosophical and pragmatic book, which lays out his answers. He begins with his business philosophy, exploring the importance of values, candor, differentiation, and voice and dignity for all. The core of the book looks inside the company, from leadership to picking winners to making change happen; outside, at the competition; and at managing your career--from finding the right job to achieving work-life balance',0,NULL,'OL9218577M',384,'',0,'approved',NULL,'2025-08-27 12:32:29','2025-08-27 12:32:29'),('d242310a-fc59-4e1c-ae87-6e95c892ed6e','Love Stories from the Qur’an',NULL,'',0,NULL,'OL32011294M',124,'',0,'approved',NULL,'2025-08-27 12:32:29','2025-08-27 12:32:29'),('d251abc1-f080-4ec1-84a4-68561de549ec','Red Queen',NULL,'',0,NULL,'',388,'',0,'approved',NULL,'2025-08-27 12:32:29','2025-08-27 12:32:29'),('d2747909-2fc2-43a3-8478-ef0120df6577','Think big',NULL,'',0,NULL,'OL1547801M',269,'',0,'approved',NULL,'2025-08-27 12:32:29','2025-08-27 12:32:29'),('d27b54e3-16e5-4e3f-a6fc-830c03d20470','History of art',NULL,'',0,NULL,'OL2531764M',824,'',0,'approved',NULL,'2025-08-27 12:32:29','2025-08-27 12:32:29'),('d2c2e30f-eb9d-4997-b4e4-8e9b0c89a305','Fast Food Nation',NULL,'',0,NULL,'OL7469003M',385,'',0,'approved',NULL,'2025-08-27 12:32:29','2025-08-27 12:32:29'),('d2c8cfd9-9338-43d8-9c97-665cc1e73889','Cookbook',NULL,'A cookbook from a series of cookbooks by Betty Crocker, a fictional character used to pool together several different meals from a multitude of peoples.',0,NULL,'OL2227848M',480,'',0,'approved',NULL,'2025-08-27 12:32:29','2025-08-27 12:32:29'),('d2cd34d7-41d8-423e-8266-7a0de85fd817','Plays',NULL,'',0,NULL,'OL14964405M',420,'',0,'approved',NULL,'2025-08-27 12:32:29','2025-08-27 12:32:29'),('d3175be7-cf0f-487d-ad7d-9e6e1d07cfb0','Evgeniĭ Onegin',NULL,'',0,NULL,'OL6347141M',243,'',0,'approved',NULL,'2025-08-27 12:32:29','2025-08-27 12:32:29'),('d39b0364-cbc6-4d3e-9068-68fdca96dc47','Slaughterhouse-Five',NULL,'',0,NULL,'OL13788314M',196,'',0,'approved',NULL,'2025-08-27 12:32:29','2025-08-27 12:32:29'),('d3b36f4d-fb1e-4944-9e98-cef24a830bd7','A homemade life',NULL,'Author of the internationally famous blog, Orangette, Molly Wizenberg recounts a life with the kitchen at its center. From her mother\'s pound cake, a staple of summer picnics during her childhood in Oklahoma, to the eggs she cooked for her father during the weeks before his death, food and memories are intimately entwined.',0,NULL,'OL17076156M',320,'',0,'approved',NULL,'2025-08-27 12:32:29','2025-08-27 12:32:29'),('d3b9f4d0-c678-423c-a0b0-32c116045003','帰ってください！ 阿久津さん　（１）',NULL,'A raunchy rom-com about a quiet guy and his voluptuous houseguest who just won’t stop making herself at home!\\n\\nTimid Ooyama keeps to himself at school, but what’s he supposed to do when notorious delinquent Akutsu Riko claims his apartment as her hangout?! Reading his manga, sprawling on his bed, and digging up his smut stash—she’s as gorgeous as she is scary. There’s no way she could possibly LIKE him, though…is there?',0,NULL,'OL49342467M',146,'',0,'approved',NULL,'2025-08-27 12:32:29','2025-08-27 12:32:29'),('d3c9ea6b-5558-4895-b65e-ea29acfd1b87','The Rainmaker',NULL,'',0,NULL,'OL27112865M',561,'',0,'approved',NULL,'2025-08-27 12:32:29','2025-08-27 12:32:29'),('d3cc9e9a-af53-4854-b3af-325b67142431','Eagles',NULL,'',0,NULL,'OL11990571M',110,'',0,'approved',NULL,'2025-08-27 12:32:29','2025-08-27 12:32:29'),('d40267af-9529-4cef-9b2b-325b305b7551','How to Do Nothing',NULL,'',0,NULL,'OL27258148M',256,'',0,'approved',NULL,'2025-08-27 12:32:29','2025-08-27 12:32:29'),('d402a16d-7ad0-40c5-b777-ea8d0be482d4','The Curious Incident of the Dog in the Night-Time',NULL,'',0,NULL,'OL3563061M',251,'',0,'approved',NULL,'2025-08-27 12:32:29','2025-08-27 12:32:29'),('d42fdf91-c5cb-45fb-a680-5d3568d38f26','Death on the Nile',NULL,'',0,NULL,'OL47461471M',287,'',0,'approved',NULL,'2025-08-27 12:32:29','2025-08-27 12:32:29'),('d43a9ea8-447c-4fd2-b0a2-97dbc3275636','The Satanic Bible',NULL,'',0,NULL,'OL17546374M',272,'',0,'approved',NULL,'2025-08-27 12:32:29','2025-08-27 12:32:29'),('d4596907-8353-4b79-9bed-ab233ce42457','Finite and infinite games',NULL,'',0,NULL,'OL2720840M',152,'',0,'approved',NULL,'2025-08-27 12:32:29','2025-08-27 12:32:29'),('d486d1b9-704a-4953-8a76-c10eb37d14b6','If Tomorrow Comes',NULL,'',0,NULL,'OL21618175M',415,'',0,'approved',NULL,'2025-08-27 12:32:29','2025-08-27 12:32:29'),('d49bb29b-e6be-4bb4-908e-dddf4dc628f1','And Then There Were None',NULL,'One by one, the guests arrived at the mansion on Indian Island, summoned by a mysterious host. And one by one, with terrifying meticulousness, they were stalked by a cunning murderer. \\n\\nUtterly baffling...and yet there was a pattern concealed in a nursery rhyme hanging over the fireplace...\\n(back cover)',0,NULL,'OL32520899M',231,'',0,'approved',NULL,'2025-08-27 12:32:29','2025-08-27 12:32:29'),('d4a9b7f0-d3f7-4d38-83de-d86802650785','Leonardo',NULL,'',0,NULL,'OL8633521M',140,'',0,'approved',NULL,'2025-08-27 12:32:29','2025-08-27 12:32:29'),('d5453d70-666a-4cd3-998d-89ccd4a61fd0','The Godfather',NULL,'',0,NULL,'',450,'',0,'approved',NULL,'2025-08-27 12:32:29','2025-08-27 12:32:29'),('d5464a07-09ad-4022-868c-96f3b0472848','The Importance of Being Earnest',NULL,'<p><i>The Importance of Being Earnest</i> is <a href=\"https://standardebooks.org/ebooks/oscar-wilde\">Oscar Wilde’s</a> most popular play today, enduring thanks to its easy humor, witty dialog, and clever satire. It was also one of his more successful plays, despite its first run being prematurely ended after only 86 performances. The main characters pretend to be other people in order to escape social obligations, with the resulting confusion of identities driving the plot and the humor behind it.</p>\\n			<p><i>Earnest</i> also holds the sad distinction of being Wilde’s last published play. A feud with an aristocrat whose son was Wilde’s lover led to a court case revealing Wilde as a homosexual—a crime in those days, and punishable by imprisonment with hard labor.</p>',0,NULL,'OL9694914M',101,'',0,'approved',NULL,'2025-08-27 12:32:29','2025-08-27 12:32:29'),('d5726612-02bb-4ad7-8b4d-a425ea0a8c33','The Boxcar Children',NULL,'',0,NULL,'OL32722268M',154,'',0,'approved',NULL,'2025-08-27 12:32:29','2025-08-27 12:32:29'),('d5a3a7e4-1b23-4e59-85c0-42c11f632343','The Adventures of Sherlock Holmes [12 stories]',NULL,'',0,NULL,'OL24349267M',310,'',0,'approved',NULL,'2025-08-27 12:32:29','2025-08-27 12:32:29'),('d5b9c3dd-c20e-436e-b4df-63e83ab6d694','Works (Carrie / Night Shift / \'Salem\'s Lot / Shining)',NULL,'',0,NULL,'OL8291805M',992,'',0,'approved',NULL,'2025-08-27 12:32:29','2025-08-27 12:32:29'),('d5d17a94-e012-4bec-a981-02740967f2d2','Picasso',NULL,'',0,NULL,'OL9101853M',107,'',0,'approved',NULL,'2025-08-27 12:32:29','2025-08-27 12:32:29'),('d5d9815a-d02c-4dff-810e-16049e32e338','On Sparta',NULL,'',0,NULL,'OL7355491M',304,'',0,'approved',NULL,'2025-08-27 12:32:29','2025-08-27 12:32:29'),('d5ff0863-79ed-4dea-a28c-92824cd73c3a','The Fall of the House of Usher',NULL,'Project Gutenberg edition released 1997-06-01',0,NULL,'OL33133952M',48,'',0,'approved',NULL,'2025-08-27 12:32:29','2025-08-27 12:32:29'),('d60e09a4-52cf-4b85-b896-24a7e5c300f1','La tabla de Flandes',NULL,'',0,NULL,'OL9116640M',364,'',0,'approved',NULL,'2025-08-27 12:32:29','2025-08-27 12:32:29'),('d636f81f-ae93-4700-97c7-07bb18fec6b1','The Hunting of the Snark',NULL,'',0,NULL,'OL13447334M',83,'',0,'approved',NULL,'2025-08-27 12:32:29','2025-08-27 12:32:29'),('d641eafd-cb4e-4257-a28f-f22c10985874','Eleanor & Park',NULL,'',0,NULL,'OL27377249M',336,'',0,'approved',NULL,'2025-08-27 12:32:29','2025-08-27 12:32:29'),('d65d1b22-6aed-4a4a-9699-37e7220c4d4e','TV Talk 3',NULL,'DEDICATION: \\nYoung viewers have helped make television stars of the people in this book. To all of you...and to E, Ginger and Sam...this book is dedicated. Peggy Herz July, 1977',1,NULL,'OL10698342M',107,'',0,'approved',NULL,'2025-08-27 12:32:29','2025-08-27 12:32:29'),('d66bde39-0168-4c27-b643-a9c33b246df7','Flowers for Algernon',NULL,'FLOWERS FOR ALGERNON made its first appearance as a short story which was rapidly and widely anthologized, and translated internationally. It received further acclaimed as a memorable television drama, and as a motion picture production. Now, full-bodied and richly peopled, FLOWERS FOR ALGERNON is the daring novel of a startling human experiment!\\n(back cover)',0,NULL,'OL39823060M',267,'',0,'approved',NULL,'2025-08-27 12:32:29','2025-08-27 12:32:29'),('d67cc6f1-8038-40a4-8f00-a5eac43cd361','2001',NULL,'THIS IS A SIMPLIFIED VERSION, NOT THE ORIGINAL TEXT. Pearson English Graded Readers are an excellent tool to improve vocabulary, sentence structure and of course reading skills. Flexible in nature, they can be used in the classroom, at home or even during the holidays so students keep in touch with English. They are accessible to all ages from 12+ and to all levels of English because the language has been simplified to match the abilities of your students.',0,NULL,'OL24857274M',236,'',0,'approved',NULL,'2025-08-27 12:32:29','2025-08-27 12:32:29'),('d6aba605-ee9c-4f11-ac81-5d7dd4fbc1be','Riding Freedom',NULL,'A fictionalized account of Charley (Charlotte) Parkhurst who ran away from an orphanage, posed as a boy, moved to California, and fooled everyone by her appearance.',0,NULL,'OL672021M',138,'',0,'approved',NULL,'2025-08-27 12:32:29','2025-08-27 12:32:29'),('d6ad5fd6-22b0-4cd7-8446-af9d28c33f4c','Life on the Mississippi',NULL,'',0,NULL,'OL17860982M',452,'',0,'approved',NULL,'2025-08-27 12:32:29','2025-08-27 12:32:29'),('d6b0daf0-6513-45d4-a70d-4ec40e67642e','Exploding The Phone The Untold Story Of The Teenagers And Outlaws Who Hacked Ma Bell',NULL,'',0,NULL,'',440,'',0,'approved',NULL,'2025-08-27 12:32:29',